---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout>
  <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Puff Collab puffin" width="120" height="120" />
  <h1>Work on code.<br />Keep your team in the loop.</h1>
  <p>Puff Collab runs coding agents on your computer, using your own provider account. Share threads through a hub so teammates can follow the work, leave comments, and review diffs.</p>
  <a class="action" href="/download">Start the desktop app</a>
  <h2>Your checkout, your coding session</h2>
  <p>Open a local project, choose a provider, and give the agent a task. Review its changes, run your checks, and commit through your usual Git workflow.</p>
  <h2>Collaboration across computers</h2>
  <p>Each teammate uses their own application and repository checkout. Link to the same hub, join a project, and share the threads you want others to see. The thread owner controls the agent; comments stay discussion.</p>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/uzgorenm/puffcollab#readme">Read the complete usage guide</a></p>
</Layout>
